{"id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-cardinal.md","title":"cardinal","display":"df-cardinal — cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-cardinal","aliases":["57-df-cardinal"],"display":"df-cardinal — cardinal","depends_on":["[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-injective]]","[[57-df-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinal — cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dba95994ca7a6dc4\" href=\"?note=dba95994ca7a6dc4\" title=\"57-df-injective\">57-df-injective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>背景为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为任意集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span>、等势及基数在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in|_\\alpha\">\\(\\in|_\\alpha\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 上的成员关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dba95994ca7a6dc4\" href=\"?note=dba95994ca7a6dc4\" title=\"57-df-injective\">57-df-injective</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ran}\">\\(\\mathrm{ran}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall y\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x),\\\\\nX\\approx Y\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists f\\;(f:X\\to Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg(\\alpha\\approx\\kappa),\\\\\n|X|=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land X\\approx\\kappa,\\\\\n|X|\\le|Y|\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y),\\\\\n\\aleph_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega,\\qquad\n\\omega_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\aleph_1\\coloneqq\\omega_1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall y\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x),\\\\\nX\\approx Y\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists f\\;(f:X\\to Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg(\\alpha\\approx\\kappa),\\\\\n|X|=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land X\\approx\\kappa,\\\\\n|X|\\le|Y|\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y),\\\\\n\\aleph_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\omega,\\qquad\n\\omega_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\aleph_1\\coloneqq\\omega_1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"dba95994ca7a6dc4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-range]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景为 ZFC；$\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa$ 为集合，$X,Y$ 为任意集合。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$\\mathrm{Card}$、等势及基数在下式定义；$\\omega$ 见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\in|_\\alpha$ 表示 $\\alpha$ 上的成员关系。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"dba95994ca7a6dc4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Injective}$ 取 [[57-df-injective]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ran}$ 取 [[57-df-range]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\in|_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall y\\in\\alpha\\;(x\\in y\\lor x=y\\lor y\\in x),\\\\\nX\\approx Y\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists f\\;(f:X\\to Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{ran}(f)=Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Ord}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg(\\alpha\\approx\\kappa),\\\\\n|X|=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land X\\approx\\kappa,\\\\\n|X|\\le|Y|\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y),\\\\\n\\aleph_0&\\coloneqq\\omega,\\qquad\n\\omega_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}(\\alpha)\\land|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\aleph_1\\coloneqq\\omega_1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"7aafa519603f2c09","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$，见 [[57-df-cardinal]]。量化结构均属于 $\\mathrm{Struct}_S$；$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 是载体的基数，见 [[57-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"0d3445b68d4cfbdb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}$ 取 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的明确语义表示。对 $S\\in\\mathcal V$ 和 $n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S(\\vec c)$ 在 $S$ 上加入互异新常量 $c_1,\\ldots,c_n$；对 $\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n$，$\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}$ 是同载体扩张，$c_i^{\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}}=a_i$，其他符号解释不变。$\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}$ 用这些有限参数命名的句子定义；$\\subseteq$ 是一阶子结构关系。$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$ 为 [[57-df-cardinal]] 的基数谓词，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 为载体基数，$|S|$ 为总字母表基数。"},{"id":"384c24ae38b35244","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e551d27957ab42ad","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S$ 保持 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的字母表集合约定，不是 88 的签名元组；$|S|$ 因而是该字母表的基数。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，模型与结构见 [[57-df-sentence]]、[[57-df-model]]、[[57-df-structure]]。假定 $\\Phi$ 有无限模型，即 $\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak M,S)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\\land\\aleph_0\\leq||\\mathfrak M||)$。$\\kappa$ 是 [[57-df-cardinal]] 的基数；$||\\mathfrak A||$ 缩写论域集合 $|\\mathfrak A|$ 的基数。"},{"id":"246ebb0467f65731","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 且 $\\aleph_0\\leq|A|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\kappa$ 为基数，$\\max\\{|A|,|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa$，见 [[57-df-cardinal]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\preccurlyeq$ 见 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]。保留旧符号 $\\|S\\|$，在本文件固定为 $\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}$。"},{"id":"2e3d328f04769ef7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，见 [[57-df-sentence]]。假定 $\\Phi$ 存在无限模型；模型、论域与基数见 [[57-df-model]]、[[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-cardinal]]。$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$ 且 $\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa$；$||\\mathfrak A||$ 表示论域基数。紧致性见 [[57-thm-compactness]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omeg